g compensation can lead to higher productivity, which in turn may encourage firms to invest more in R&D, creating a positive feedback loop. [Data: Entities (2024, 1359, 2022, 1304), Relationships (2781, 2593, 1665)]"], "parameters": {"model": "nomic-embed-text"}}, "key": "embeddings_8ba69b41f951a63bf77a3a38661f4a466366d0a1d70872c265d84c1648df11f8_v2"}